<title>LUXEMBOURG: Cargolux May 1997 traffic up 19pct.</title>
<headline>Cargolux May 1997 traffic up 19pct.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargolux Airlines International said it flew 185.9 million freight tonne kilometres (FTK) last month, up 19 percent on May 1996.</p>
<p>The Luxembourg-based cargo airline flew 894.6 million FTK in the first five months of 1997, an increase of 15 percent on the same period last year.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
